  > > q
+
x <- markup.list.continuation.carve

x Below a top-level indented `>` line, which is paragraph text, a `+` is
x text too; under a footnote the same lines are a quote and a marker.

  > q
+
x <- -markup.list.continuation.carve

  > q
x ^ -markup.quote.carve

